## 📁 src/modules/ Directory

### Module Structure Pattern

**Each module follows the layered architecture:**

```
module-name/
│
├── module-name.model.js          # Mongoose schema + model
├── module-name.validation.js     # Joi validation schemas
├── module-name.service.js        # Business logic layer
├── module-name.repository.js     # Data access layer (optional)
├── module-name.controller.js     # HTTP request/response handling
├── module-name.routes.js         # Express route definitions
│
└── __tests__/                    # Module-specific tests
    ├── module-name.unit.test.js          # Service layer tests
    └── module-name.integration.test.js   # API endpoint tests
```

